    "#### 5. SyntaxError\n",
    "   Raised when you disobey python code writing rules.\n",
    "   Python IDEs are generous to inform this before you even run your code via tooltips and underlines.\n",
    "   IDEs even have intellisense and code suggestions to help write the correct syntax."
